<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>BioPharma Dive - Latest News</title><link>https://www.biopharmadive.com/news/</link><description>BioPharma</description><atom:link href="https://www.biopharmadive.com/feeds/news/" rel="self"/><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:26:00 -0500</lastBuildDate><item><title>Medicare sets 2028 prices for 13 new drugs under Biden-era law</title><link>https://www.biopharmadive.com/news/inflation-reduction-act-2028-final-medicare-drug-price/875717/</link><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/yNFj1iOXXiGXHrvNzMITrI7Zf52PfwK1rovRc0StZW8/g:ce/rs:fill:1600:900:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS9HZXR0eUltYWdlcy0xMDQ3NTA1MDAwLmpwZw==.webp"/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Drugs nearing or past patent expiration are facing steep cuts as the Inflation Reduction Act expands the number of medicines subject to cost controls.&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Jonathan Gardner</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:26:00 -0500</pubDate><guid>https://www.biopharmadive.com/news/inflation-reduction-act-2028-final-medicare-drug-price/875717/</guid></item><item><title>Amgen takes next step toward biosimilar Opdivo; Bristol Myers taps a new finance head</title><link>https://www.biopharmadive.com/news/arcus-quemliclustat-belite-amgen-opdivo-biosimilar/875512/</link><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/idsdMAHsPbXObDUtQW2qRG7uveBUVv6HCTn9NTtlDOI/g:nowe:0:0/c:1207:682/rs:fill:1600:900:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS9HZXR0eUltYWdlcy0xNDgzOTIxNzkzLmpwZw==.webp"/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;It&amp;rsquo;s the second big change to Bristol Myers&amp;rsquo; executive ranks this month. Elsewhere, Cogent secured a cancer drug approval while Arcus Biosciences and Belite Bio hit setbacks.&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">BioPharma Dive staff</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:24:00 -0500</pubDate><guid>https://www.biopharmadive.com/news/arcus-quemliclustat-belite-amgen-opdivo-biosimilar/875512/</guid></item><item><title>FDA approves BridgeBio muscular dystrophy drug</title><link>https://www.biopharmadive.com/news/fda-bridgebio-welgemda-limb-girdle-muscle-disorder-approval/875610/</link><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/OR8SxLe6A-mfa2L56w6SQj-pPoUqhUUQiBQvTR5zGx4/g:ce/rs:fill:1600:900:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS9HZXR0eUltYWdlcy0xNDEzMjg5OTM2LmpwZw==.webp"/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wall Street analysts say a price of nearly $1 million a year should drive blockbuster sales for a medicine that helped patients walk and breathe better.&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Jonathan Gardner</dc:creator><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:36:00 -0500</pubDate><guid>https://www.biopharmadive.com/news/fda-bridgebio-welgemda-limb-girdle-muscle-disorder-approval/875610/</guid></item><item><title>FDA clears Roche’s oral SERD as treatment in early-stage breast cancer</title><link>https://www.biopharmadive.com/news/fda-roche-wilserdly-breast-cancer-approval-early-stage/875563/</link><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/_Jl91qpyunJWe-csdceqrcSO_PmI-VBjWQO1KOBqP58/g:ce/rs:fill:1600:900:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS9HZXR0eUltYWdlcy0xOTM3MjY1MDU5LmpwZw==.webp"/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;The latest approval represents a large market opportunity for a drug Roche has touted to become a top-selling, multibillion-dollar product.&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Delilah Alvarado</dc:creator><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:36:00 -0500</pubDate><guid>https://www.biopharmadive.com/news/fda-roche-wilserdly-breast-cancer-approval-early-stage/875563/</guid></item><item><title>Sanofi, with $41B Insmed buy, inks year’s biggest biopharma acquisition</title><link>https://www.biopharmadive.com/news/sanofi-insmed-acquisition-deal-immunology-rare-disease/875627/</link><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/FBR1IQNmU9Hqatva496Zg2G8JMHsqV0UGsf4LMARqYo/g:nowe:189:144/c:1776:1003/rs:fill:1600:900:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS80OTY5MDc4MzcxMl8yYTc1ZmQ5M2MyX28uanBn.webp"/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pointing to Insmed&amp;rsquo;s pipeline and two commercial drugs, Sanofi said the deal will be &amp;ldquo;transformative&amp;rdquo; as well as complementary to its immunology and rare disease products.&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Jacob Bell</dc:creator><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:50:59 -0500</pubDate><guid>https://www.biopharmadive.com/news/sanofi-insmed-acquisition-deal-immunology-rare-disease/875627/</guid></item></channel></rss>